Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:41:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Let a theme show the main menu's version line at its bottom

On full-screen menus the version line sat under the main menu's
title as the raw version string, build time and tags included.

menufooter gains atBottom: the main menu then shows a short line at
its bottom, under the list and any buttons: the system's name, its
version without the time or bracketed tags, and the board, in
capitals and separated by middle dots. Without it nothing changes.
